@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   實作
' chapter:      7-2
' realizes:     FR-01, FR-05, FR-08, FR-13, FR-17, FR-19, NFR-01, NFR-10
' source:       backend/src/（目錄與 require 關係）, backend/package.json（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-25
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / Claude Code / 依 backend/src 各目錄 require 關係與 package.json 重繪分層、例外依賴與第三方套件；v3-1 移除版本（版本見第 9 章）
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title 後端套件圖

package "backend/src" as Src {
  package "啟動（server.js、app.js）" as Entry {
    rectangle "連線資料庫、開機復原排程\n掛載 middleware 與 /api/v1" as EntryFiles
  }
  package "routes" as Routes {
    rectangle "index.js 與 15 個 *.routes.js" as RouteFiles
  }
  package "middleware" as Middleware {
    rectangle "auth／role／upload\nlineSignature／internalProcessingAuth\nerror／securityHeaders" as MwFiles
  }
  package "controllers" as Controllers {
    rectangle "15 個 *.controller.js" as CtlFiles
  }
  package "services" as Services {
    rectangle "60 個 *.service.js\n（業務規則與外部 adapter）" as SvcFiles
  }
  package "models" as Models {
    rectangle "21 個 Mongoose model" as ModelFiles
  }
  package "config、constants" as Config {
    rectangle "env.js／database.js／cors.js\nenums.js" as CfgFiles
  }
  package "utils" as Utils {
    rectangle "apiResponse／AppError\nObjectId 驗證" as UtilFiles
  }
}

package "第三方函式庫（npm）" as Libs {
  package "Web 框架" as WebLib <<library>> {
    rectangle "express\ncors／morgan\nswagger-ui-express" as WebVer
  }
  package "安全與上傳" as SecLib <<library>> {
    rectangle "jsonwebtoken\nbcryptjs\nmulter" as SecVer
  }
  package "資料存取" as DataLib <<library>> {
    rectangle "mongoose" as DataVer
  }
  package "寄信" as MailLib <<library>> {
    rectangle "nodemailer" as MailVer
  }
}

Entry ..> Routes : 掛載 /api/v1
Entry ..> Middleware : 安全標頭、錯誤處理
Entry ..> Services : 開機復原與排程
Routes ..> Middleware : 驗證、角色、上傳、驗簽
Routes ..> Controllers : 分派請求
Routes ..> Services : health、stats 直接查詢
Controllers ..> Services : 呼叫業務規則
Controllers ..> Utils : 統一回應格式
Services ..> Models : 查詢與寫入
Services ..> Config : feature flag、provider
Services ..> Utils : 錯誤與驗證
Middleware ..> Models : 驗證 User 狀態
Models ..> Config : collection 名稱、enum
Entry ..> WebLib
Middleware ..> SecLib
Services ..> SecLib : 簽發 JWT、雜湊密碼
Models ..> DataLib
Services ..> MailLib : 忘記密碼驗證信

@enduml
